{{\pard\intbl \ql \f0 \sa0 \li0 \fi0 {\b No-op in this build.} Lives in the {\i fast} transient detector, which is only reached under AAC-LD/ELD - and {\f1 -p 23} / {\f1 -p 39} fail to initialise here (also in the stock binary). Kept for completeness only.\par}
\cell}
}
\intbl\row}
{
\trowd \trgaph120
\cellx2160\cellx4320\cellx6480\cellx8640
