{{\pard\intbl \ql \f0 \sa0 \li0 \fi0 Missing harmonics: scales how {\i tonal} a band must be before SBR fabricates a synthetic harmonic. Lower = more added tones (risk of whistling artefacts); higher = fewer (dull bells and cymbals, lost partials).\par}
