{{\pard\intbl \ql \f0 \sa0 \li0 \fi0 The smallest legal .m4a: omits the ENTIRE {\f1 udta}/metadata block (encoder tag + gapless iTunSMPB + all tags). The playback skeleton stays intact.\par}
\cell}
